    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00808",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“别逗啦。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Don't be ridiculous.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00808",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "马咯要是知道了，必定会笑掉大牙呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If Mag found out, he would surely laugh his head off.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00808",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "在你们日本，工人阶级的女儿不也沦为妓女了吗？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "In your Japan too, haven't the daughters of the working class fallen into prostitution?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00808",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "你觉得吃河童职工的肉令你愤慨，这是感伤主义在作祟。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "If eating the flesh of kappa workers outrages you, that is sentimentalism at work.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
